{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"newborn-advanced-hoopoe","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Problem\n\nIn the live prompt-eval loop (`rebar.llm.evals.eval.run_eval` per dataset-bearing spec, the `eval-live` job in `.github/workflows/prompt-eval.yml`), seven plan-review criterion specs fail some cases with:\n\n```\nreview result failed schema validation: 'dimension' is a required property\n```\n\nSpecs affected (case counts at `REBAR_EVAL_MAX_CASES=12`, 3 epochs, 5.5 run): plan-review-G7 (6), plan-review-ac-process-gate (2), plan-review-asserted-capability (5), plan-review-decomp-shape (2), plan-review-evidence-kind (14), plan-review-necessity (2), plan-review-no-file-impact (3).\n\n## Reproduction (measured 2026-11-09)\n\nThe same failure appears on origin/main 872e7f6c3fd with Opus 4.8 / Sonnet 4.6 (plan-review-G7 JUnit carries 6 'dimension' messages) and on the 5.5 upgrade stack, so it is not model-specific. Runs were made inside a local gate session (workaround for bug `dissocial-unpleasant-adouri`).\n\n## Expected\n\nEither the solver's review result carries `dimension`, or the result schema no longer requires it on this path; these cases should be scored on the model's answer, not lost to a schema error.\n\n## Notes\n\nFound while recording before/after prompt evals for the model upgrade. Which component emits the result without `dimension` was not traced.","id":"246e-71dd-911a-4742","parent_id":"","priority":3,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"Prompt evals: plan-review criterion specs fail with \"'dimension' is a required property\" schema error"},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1794277673014852001,"uuid":"46460f21-0293-4609-a822-c5617f89972a"}